{"story":{"id":"story-436ab002199346b7","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]解释道","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName], Explained"},"category":"society","image":"art/90bcb3eb7885cac6a169.webp","start":"first_contact.378","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们已经破译出[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]足够多的语言，现在我们可以与他们进行通讯——并理解他们先前的广播。\n\n似乎[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]是一个好战社会，他们以最具威胁的战吼问候我们来测试我们的勇气。不幸的是，我们在翻译他们语言时的谨慎态度意味着他们的挑衅并没有被正面回应，使得他们得出我们是懦夫文明的结论。要改变这一第一印象需要花费我们很长时间了。","en":"We have managed to decipher enough of the language used by the civilization we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] to open communications with them - and to make sense of their earlier broadcasts.\n\nIt seems that the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpe"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.378"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.378","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.378","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]解释道","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName], Explained"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们已经破译出[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]足够多的语言，现在我们可以与他们进行通讯——并理解他们先前的广播。\n\n似乎[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]是一个好战社会，他们以最具威胁的战吼问候我们来测试我们的勇气。不幸的是，我们在翻译他们语言时的谨慎态度意味着他们的挑衅并没有被正面回应，使得他们得出我们是懦夫文明的结论。要改变这一第一印象需要花费我们很长时间了。","en":"We have managed to decipher enough of the language used by the civilization we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] to open communications with them - and to make sense of their earlier broadcasts.\n\nIt seems that the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural] are a warlike society who greeted us with their most fearsome warcry, apparently to test our mettle. Unfortunately, our caution in translating their language meant that their challenge went unanswered, leading them to the conclusion that we are a civilization of cowards. It will take quite some time for us to live down this first impression..."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/90bcb3eb7885cac6a169.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"这样不妥！","en":"This will not do!"},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84a703"},{"target":"first_contact.1105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-f4810be797c73d62"},{"target":"first_contact.1110","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-4c442c803066d8b5"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_fruitful"},{"target":"cara.1020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-d7b8fcad4ef27504"},{"target":"cara.2020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-c9b49b23ac539406"},{"target":"cara.3020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-2bb89e85cc3f8c94"},{"target":"marauder.15","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_heirs_of_the_khan"},{"target":"leviathans.102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-80b79499ff487797"},{"target":"leviathans.301","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.295","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.502","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-7955ff16d7a36494"},{"target":"enclave.205","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_shroudwalker_apprentice"},{"target":"enclave.305","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-5f883b0f23e4af78"},{"target":"enclave.405","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-5f883b0f23e4af78"},{"target":"shroud.6853","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens"},{"target":"shroud.6852","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_mindwardens